        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#545B64;" value="Everything in grey, purple and pink is built and running today. The green band at the bottom is what we would add next, and none of it changes the shape of the architecture. NorthBridge University. AWS region us-east-1 (N. Virginia). Serverless, deployed with Terraform, designed for the AWS Free Tier. Disaster recovery: DynamoDB point-in-time recovery (35 days) and live replicas in eu-west-3 (Paris); S3 versioning and cross-region replication; everything rebuildable with Terraform." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="1900" x="40" y="54" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
